OL,3,GNEWSAFlustered and drenched owl saved
OL,4,A70 miles out at sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt turns out the owl did not need a cat
OL,7,For a pea green boat when it travelled
OL,8,Fto the sea, just a group of soldiers
OL,9,Fand their racing boat.
OL,11,FAn Army crew had been taking part in a
OL,12,Frace around Britain and Ireland when
OL,13,Fthey spotted a barn owl flying above
OL,14,Fthem while 70 miles off the coast of
OL,15,FNewcastle.
OL,17,FThe flustered bird attempted to land
OL,18,Fseveral times and fell into the sea
OL,19,Fbefore collapsing on the boat deck,
OL,20,Fwhere he was scooped up and given a bed
OL,21,Ffor the night.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
