OL,3,GNEWSAFlustered and drenched owl saved
OL,4,A70 miles out at sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter an eventful 24 hours with his new
OL,7,Farmy friends, Caister Independent
OL,8,Flifeboat crew met the soldiers off the
OL,9,FNorfolk coast and transported the owl
OL,10,Fto shore.
